{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0181","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000031:text","row":28560,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"薄笑い。","en":"A thin smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011883","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00001","en":"A faint smile.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000051:text","row":28561,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"俺は悪戯心に支配される。","en":"Mischief takes hold of me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011884","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00002","en":"I am controlled by a mischievous heart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000000c5:text","row":28562,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"そっと背後から近づく。","en":"I creep up behind her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011885","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00003","en":"Quietly I approach from behind.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000000f3:text","row":28563,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"気配は殺す。","en":"I conceal my presence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011886","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00004","en":"I kill my presence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000117:text","row":28564,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"物音を立てずに、そっと。","en":"Silently. Softly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011887","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00005","en":"Without making one sound, slowly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000147:text","row":28565,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"さあ、どこで気がつくかな。","en":"Let’s see how close I can get before she notices.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011888","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00006","en":"Well then, where will you notice me now.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000179:text","row":28566,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"すぐ背後で物音を立ててやろうかな。","en":"Maybe I’ll make a sound once I’m right behind her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011889","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00007","en":"Maybe I will soon make one sound from her behind.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000001f7:text","row":28567,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"一歩。また一歩。","en":"One step. Then another.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011890","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00008","en":"One step. Again one step.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000021f:text","row":28568,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が気取る様子はない。","en":"Kiri shows no sign of noticing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011891","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00009","en":"Kiri does not appear to be sensing me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000024d:text","row":28569,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"このまま抱きついたら……もう俺の勝ちだ。","en":"If I throw my arms around her now… I’ve won.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011892","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00010","en":"If I embrace her as this is... I will have beaten her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000028d:text","row":28570,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"霧の抵抗を全て封じることができる。","en":"I could stop her from resisting altogether.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011893","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00011","en":"It will be possible to prevent the entirety of Kiri's resistance.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000002c7:text","row":28571,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"気絶させるのに一分かからない。","en":"It wouldn’t take me a minute to knock her out.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011894","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00012","en":"It will not take one minute to make her lose senses.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000002fd:text","row":28572,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"そして―――","en":"And then—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011895","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00013","en":"And then---","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000329:text","row":28573,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000034d:text","row":28574,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"ふと。","en":"All at once.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011896","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00015","en":"Suddenly,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000036b:text","row":28575,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"自分がひどい劣情に突き動かされていることを自覚する。","en":"I realize I’m being driven by a vile lust.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011897","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00016","en":"I become aware that I have been pushed to act by hideous carnal desires.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000003b7:text","row":28576,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"いけない、このままだと。","en":"This is bad. If I keep going—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011898","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00017","en":"What is going on is... not to be.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000003e7:text","row":28577,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"霧を、傷つける。","en":"I’ll hurt Kiri.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011899","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00018","en":"It would hurt Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000417:text","row":28578,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00019","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00019","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000047f:text","row":28579,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"一歩、下がる。","en":"I step back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011900","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00020","en":"One step, I move back.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000004a5:text","row":28580,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"物音を立てずにだ。","en":"Without making a sound.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011901","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00021","en":"Without making one sound.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000513:text","row":28581,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"下がって、下がって、元の位置。","en":"Back, back, until I’m where I started.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011902","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00022","en":"Move back, move back, to my original position.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:0000061a:text","row":28582,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"と、霧が振り返った。","en":"That’s when Kiri turns around.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011903","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00023","en":"And there Kiri turned around.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000646:text","row":28583,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"入り口近くに俺の姿を認めて、ぎょっとする。","en":"She spots me by the entrance and gives a start.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011904","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00024","en":"She notices my figure at the entrance and startles.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000690:text","row":28584,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「へーい」","en":"“Heeey.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011905","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00025","en":"Taichi: \"Heeey.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000006d5:text","row":28585,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「……黒須、先輩」","en":"“…Kurosu.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011906","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00026","en":"Kiri: \"...Kurosu... senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000006ff:text","row":28586,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"敵同士みたいな空気が漂う。","en":"It feels as if we’re enemies.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011907","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00027","en":"A mood of mutual enmity drifts in.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000739:text","row":28587,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうそう。霧ちんの黒須先輩」","en":"“That’s me. Your very own Kurosu, Kiri-kins.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011908","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00028","en":"Taichi: \"Yeppy yep. This your Kurosu-senpai, Kiri-chin!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000792:text","row":28588,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ご用は？」","en":"“…Did you need something?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011909","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00029","en":"Kiri: \"...your business?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000007c2:text","row":28589,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「ないよ」","en":"“Nothing.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011910","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00030","en":"Taichi: \"None!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:000007e4:text","row":28590,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"ぴっと入り口を指さす。","en":"She points sharply at the entrance.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011911","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00031","en":"She points to the entrance with a sharp motion.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0181:00000835:text","row":28591,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「出ていって下さい。こちらも要件はありませんので」","en":"“Please leave. I have no business with you, either.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011912","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013a:00032","en":"Kiri: \"Please leave. We have no requirement of you either.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
